OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters turn 'violent' in new
OL,4,Acycle path row
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome protesters reportedly turned
OL,7,Fviolent as they attempted to "storm a
OL,8,Fcouncil building" amid a row over a new
OL,9,Fcycle path.
OL,11,FThe incident unfolded outside Bath and
OL,12,FNorth East Somerset Council's (Banes)
OL,13,FGuildhall as cabinet members met on
OL,14,FThursday to discuss the proposed route
OL,15,Fin Royal Victoria Park.
OL,17,FCouncil leader Kevin Guy labelled the
OL,18,Fprotest "a politicised attempt to
OL,19,Fsubvert the democratic process via
OL,20,Fviolence" that was "far from peaceful".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
