OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters turn 'violent' in new
OL,4,Acycle path row
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut protester Dave Dixon, who was
OL,7,Finside the building, said: "[It was]
OL,8,Fnot really a scuffle, they just shut
OL,9,Fthe doors and that upset a few
OL,10,Foutside."
